# boost.jsc - cruise, then hold SPACE for 3 s, then release.
# Checks: flame ~6 u at cruise and ~20 u at boost with shock dots and a white core (group C);
# boost speed ~122 u/s (group D); --wav: engine audio rises with boost.
0     persist assist 2
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.5  seek sea 40
+1.5  shot cruise
+0    assert speed > 60
+0    assert speed < 76
+0.2  hold SPACE 3.0
+1.0  shot boost_a
+0.3  shot boost_b
+0.8  assert speed > 110
+0    assert speed < 135
+0    shot boost_full
+2.0  shot after_boost
+0    sheet boost 5
+0    end
